-- ═══ REVIEW ROUND — findings and REPAIRS (2026-08-22, post-adversarial-review) ═══
-- The adversarial review returned 1 blocker + 3 minors. Repairs recorded AS
-- repairs; the numbers below SUPERSEDE the H6/H7 figures above.

-- ── D1 (BLOCKER, found by review — NOT pre-registered; the ledger above wrongly
--    claimed the E-PLAN-003 class closed) — FIXED ──
-- Defect: a POSITIVE, variable-INTRODUCING §3.1 open-space body leg on a
--   today-accepted program tripped E-PLAN-003 at prod-scale stats. Pre-P3 the
--   leg classified LegSource::Builtin (estimate 1); the first P3 cut classified
--   it Derived with NO estimates entry, so leg_estimate fell to
--   derived_estimate's whole-graph None-fallback: with
--   Stats{413_000 nodes, 1_200_000 edges, FUNCTION: 95_000},
--   hit(X,Y) :- node(X,"FUNCTION"), fresh_pred(X,Y). estimated
--   95_000 × narrowed_fanout(1_200_000) = 104,120,000 > MAX_MATERIALIZED_FACTS
--   → spurious reject of the spec's availability HARD-REJECT class (review's
--   empirical A/B probe vs the be7d5de6 planner). Secondary: an accepted
--   free-free open-space leg estimated 1_200_000 (pre-P3: 1) — cascade fuel.
-- Escape analysis (why the gates missed it): the plan_golden battery has no
--   open-space fixture; tier-0 seeds run at fixture-scale stats where the 10M
--   guard cannot trip; the E-CAT tests cover only arity conflicts.
-- Fix (reviewer option (a), plan.rs): register_program now RETURNS the
--   open-space names it registers, and BOTH planner entry points seed their
--   estimate context with 0 for each (plan_program_with_catalog seeds
--   `estimates` before the stratum loop; plan_rule seeds its per-rule map).
--   derived_estimate's Some(k) branch then yields k.max(1) = 1 — exactly the
--   pre-P3 Builtin leg estimate — for every bind pattern, and
--   derived_column_domain yields domain 1 (an empty-by-construction relation:
--   no rules, no storage). Domains/estimates can only DROP vs pre-P3, so
--   acceptance is monotonically preserved.
-- Regression pins added (both green; both entry points covered):
--   plan.rs::open_space_positive_var_introducing_leg_plans_at_prod_scale
--     (prod-scale stats; asserts plan accepted AND estimate == 95_000, the
--     pre-P3 value verified against the be7d5de6 planner)
--   plan.rs::open_space_free_free_leg_estimates_one_at_prod_scale
--     (estimate 1 via plan_program AND via the direct plan_rule path).
-- The golden gate stays green (open-space programs are outside the battery,
--   and the seed touches no base-five path):
--   p3_plan_fingerprints_match_pre_p3_golden ok, 40,816 lines bit-identical.
claim_of[a](r_p3_d1_open_space_availability_regression_fixed).
ground[a](r_p3_d1_open_space_availability_regression_fixed, ab_probe_plus_two_prod_scale_pins_green).

